n":"(not-comparable) In the state of being active, functioning or operating.","example":"All the lights are on, so they must be home.","frame_run_id":5,"frame_seq":4,"frame_ts_ms":1792284487790,"id":"on|adjective|1","lemma":"on","norm":"on","pos":"adjective","score":0.5,"semantic_atoms":["ety:1","tag:not-comparable","pos_raw:adj"],"source":"ltm","synonyms":[],"token_index":2,"word":"on"},{"antonyms":[],"definition":"(not-comparable) Happening; taking place; being or due to be put into action.","example":"We had to ration our food because there was a war on.","frame_run_id":5,"frame_seq":4,"frame_ts_ms":1792284487790,"id":"on|adjective|2","lemma":"on","norm":"on","pos":"adjective","score":0.5,"semantic_atoms":["ety:1","tag:not-comparable","pos_raw:adj"],"source":"ltm","synonyms":[],"token_index":2,"word":"on"},{"antonyms":[],"definition":"(informal, not-comparable) Happening; taking place; being or due to be put into action. — Of a person, used to express agreement to or acceptance of a proposal or challenge made by that person; most commonly with subject \"you\" (see you're on).","example":"\"Five bucks says the Cavs win tonight.\" ―\"You're on!\"","frame_run_id":5,"frame_seq":4,"frame_ts_ms":1792284487790,"id":"on|adjective|3","lemma":"on","norm":"on","pos":"adjective","score":0.5,"semantic_atoms":["ety:1","tag:informal","tag:not-comparable","pos_raw:adj"],"source":"ltm","synonyms":[],"token_index":2,"word":"on"},{"antonyms":[],"definition":"(not-comparable) Fitted; covering or being worn.","example":"Your feet will soon warm up once your socks are on.","frame_run_id":5,"frame_seq":4,"frame_ts_ms":1792284487790,"id":"on|adjective|4","lemma":"on","norm":"on","pos":"adjective","score":0.5,"semantic_atoms":["ety:1","tag:not-comparable","pos_raw:adj"],"source":"ltm","synonyms":[],"token_index":2,"word":"on"},{"antonyms":[],"definition":"(not-comparable, postpositional) Of a stated part of something, oriented towards the viewer or other specified direction.","example":"